<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>人体点集合与倒地姿态工作台</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#111a24;color:#dce7ef;font:14px system-ui}header{padding:18px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #354657}h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 7px}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:14px;padding:16px}aside button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:0 0 8px}button,select,input{background:#233446;border:1px solid #536a7e;color:inherit;border-radius:5px;padding:8px}button{cursor:pointer}button.active{border-color:#54d8e8}button:disabled{opacity:.5}small,.muted{color:#a6b8c8}canvas{width:100%;height:510px;background:#142130;touch-action:none;border:1px solid #33485b}#controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}#time{width:100%}#status{min-height:34px;padding:8px 0}#metrics{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px;background:#1c2b39}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}td,th{padding:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #344759;text-align:left}#parts{margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}#reviewer{width:130px}a{color:#74d6e4}.warn{color:#ffd46d}#message{padding-top:10px}#summary{margin-top:14px}@media(max-width:850px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}aside{display:flex;overflow:auto;gap:8px}aside button{min-width:170px}canvas{height:420px}}
#researchControls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:center}#layers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}#layers canvas{height:220px}#layers h3{font-size:13px;min-height:38px}#fragmentDetails{white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:240px;overflow:auto}#sourceHover{min-height:22px}@media(max-width:850px){#layers{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style>
<header><h1>人体点集合与倒地姿态工作台</h1><small>冻结空场 → 三维聚类 → 中央目标关联 → 点支撑骨架 → 倒地姿态候选</small><details><summary>动作事件与历史参照</summary><div id="reviewQueue">读取中</div></details></header>
<main><aside id="sessions"></aside><section>
<div id="researchControls"><select id="variant" aria-label="实验方案"><option value="baseline">R1旧基线 · 当前默认</option><option value="point12">实验：局部前景12cm</option><option value="point20">实验：局部前景20cm</option><option value="component20">实验：20cm整碎片</option><option value="low20">实验：20cm含贴地</option><option value="axis">R2：有界历史体轴方向</option><option value="r3_graph">R3 A：图连接与形状</option><option value="r3_background">R3 B：component20＋背景排除</option><option value="r3_temporal">R3 C：component20＋因果时序</option><option value="r3_combined">R3 ABC：仅点集组合</option><option value="r3">R3初版：ABC＋局部轴（保留符号退化）</option><option value="r3_feedback">R3初版：独立tracker反馈</option><option value="r3_signed">R3修正：ABC＋因果符号连续轴（固定锚点）</option><option value="r3_signed_feedback">R3修正：独立tracker反馈＋连续轴</option></select><label><input id="diagnose" type="checkbox">五层同帧对照 · 原始/删除/前景/旧目标/未选</label><select id="case" aria-label="诊断帧"><option value="">诊断帧导航</option></select><span id="version">R3 · 默认保留R1 · 全部实验未晋级</span></div><div id="controls"><select id="dataset" aria-label="数据集"><option value="actions">八段动作 · 人体候选回放</option><option value="legacy">原九会话 · 模型与人工参照</option></select><select id="mode" aria-label="显示模式"><option value="body_3d">中央人体候选 · 仅显示目标</option><option value="roi_3d">自动 · 小活动区 3D</option><option value="full_3d">自动 · 全场 3D</option><option value="full_2d">对照 · 全场 XY 聚类</option><option value="reference">人工人体参照 · 非自动</option></select><select id="model" aria-label="人体判别模型"><option value="rf_xyz_prob">XYZ 描述符学习 · RF</option><option value="pointnet_prob">直接 XYZ · PointNet</option></select><select id="object" aria-label="对象"></select><button id="play">播放</button><button id="prev">上一帧</button><button id="next">下一帧</button><button id="marked">下一个人工已标帧</button><button id="front">正视</button><button id="top">俯视</button><button id="orbit">三维</button><label><input id="context" type="checkbox">对照：背景差分全部残余</label></div>
<input id="time" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" aria-label="帧时间轴"><div id="status"></div>
<div id="r3Controls"><label><input id="compare" type="checkbox">同帧R1 / R2整碎片 / 当前方案</label> <label><input id="evidence" type="checkbox" checked>拒绝碎片 / 近背景风险 / 连接证据</label><span>橙：恢复 · 紫：拒绝 · 红：近背景风险 · 绿线：当前连接；身份UNKNOWN</span><div id="hardJumps"></div></div>
<div id="comparePanels" hidden style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px"><div><p id="r1CompareTitle">R1</p><canvas id="r1Compare" style="height:310px"></canvas></div><div><p id="r2CompareTitle">R2 component20</p><canvas id="r2Compare" style="height:310px"></canvas></div></div>
<canvas id="cloud" aria-label="人体聚类、框体和点支撑骨架"></canvas>
<p id="evidenceNote" role="status">点击当前目标可查源行；拖动任一视图可同步旋转。R3实验身份仍UNKNOWN。</p>
<div id="metrics"></div><section id="diagnosticPanel" hidden><p id="layerStatus"></p><div id="layers"></div><p id="sourceHover">在小图点击可查看当帧显示点的源索引；拖动同步旋转。</p><a id="sourceDownload" href="#">下载五层全量源索引（NPZ）</a><details><summary>局部未选碎片与风险（身份UNKNOWN）</summary><pre id="fragmentDetails"></pre></details></section><p class="muted">框体来自当前点集；骨架为有点支撑的区域估计，头/手身份及解剖左右未知。黄色地面圈线为截图示意。人体定位为自动几何推断，倒地姿态候选不等于失衡跌倒；动作名称为录制说明。</p>
<div id="parts"><label><input id="annotate" type="checkbox">部位标注：点击选择点</label><select id="part"><option>UNKNOWN</option><option>HEAD</option><option>TORSO</option><option>LEFT_ARM</option><option>RIGHT_ARM</option><option>LEFT_LEG</option><option>RIGHT_LEG</option></select><input id="reviewer" placeholder="审核人姓名" aria-label="审核人姓名"><button id="save">保存所选点的部位</button><button id="clear">清除选择</button><span id="picked">0 点</span></div>
<div id="message" role="status"></div><p><a id="experimentDownload" hidden href="#">当前实验全量源成员与新增依据（JSON）</a> <a id="download" href="#">导出本会话已有人工人体点集（NPZ）</a> · <a id="summary" href="#">逐帧统计</a></p>
<details><summary>当前骨架节点与支撑</summary><table><thead><tr><th>区域节点</th><th>状态</th><th>源点支撑数</th></tr></thead><tbody id="nodes"></tbody></table></details>
</section></main><script src="/app.js"></script></html>
